---
Title: a callout broken across pages
---

A callout long enough to break across three pages. In LaTeX every part — first,
middle and last — must keep the accent strip and the tint (each tcolorbox skin
sets its own interior code; see callout-latex.js). latex-compile checks the
rendered pages, not only that the document compiles.

